---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | BearingCalculators" description="Privacy policy for BearingCalculators.com.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-theme-muted text-sm mb-8">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-theme-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit a quote request form, we collect your name, company, email address, phone number (optional), and the bearing specifications you provide. This information is transmitted to Formspree and forwarded to you and relevant bearing suppliers.</p>
        <p class="mt-2">We use Google Analytics 4 to collect anonymous usage data (pages visited, tool interactions). No personally identifiable information is sent to Google Analytics.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
          <li>Quote request data is used solely to facilitate bearing procurement inquiries.</li>
          <li>Analytics data helps us improve tool functionality and content.</li>
          <li>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties except bearing suppliers you specifically request quotes from.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use localStorage to remember your dark/light theme preference. Google Analytics uses cookies to distinguish users. No advertising or tracking cookies are set.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Formspree</strong>: processes form submissions. See <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" class="accent-text hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formspree Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong>: anonymous usage analytics. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="accent-text hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>: CDN and edge caching. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" class="accent-text hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions, use our <a href="/request-a-quote/" class="accent-text hover:underline">contact form</a> and indicate it's a privacy inquiry.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
